01156 {\cf18 void} CodingStructure::initSubStructure( CodingStructure& subStruct, {\cf17 const} ChannelType _chType, {\cf17 const} UnitArea &subArea, {\cf17 const} {\cf18 bool} &isTuEnc )\par
